<title>UK: ING sets 700 million guilder 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>ING sets 700 million guilder 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONALE NEDERLANDEN GROEP</p>
<p> AMT    700 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    30.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.575   PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.00     SPREAD	+47 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED CURVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
